@page "/about"

<div class="flex flex-col justify-center items-center space-y-6">

    <TitleBar />

    <Title>About Me</Title>

    <article class="max-w-4xl mx-6 mt-6 space-y-4 text-arcticgray-dark dark:text-darkarcticgray-light leading-relaxed">
        <p>
            Welcome to my small website. I'm Mikael.
        </p>
        <p>
            After spending some time in academia, I'm now looking to continue the journey of learning
            on my own time while I am searching for a suitable job. I'm currently taking an interest in the .NET ecosystem
            and I am in the process of increasing my working knowledge of it. This site is itself a product of my desire to
            explore the Blazor framework for front-end development.
        </p>

        <p>
            When I'm not learning at my computer, you can find me going for walks or perhaps behind a brass instrument
            in an Indonesian Gamelan group. I have an interest in learning about cultures and languages, and actively
            seek out opportunities to expand my world view.
        </p>

        <p>
            Thank you for visiting my site, I sincerely appreciate the time spent.
            <br>
            <span class="block h-4"></span>
            &mdash; Mikael Færøvik
        </p>
    </article>

</div>
